#### 7. Sensitive Equality
**Ref:** Van Deursen et al. 2001; testsmells.org  
**Test:** `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 122)  
**Snippet:**
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```
**Problem:** Brittle to any formatting change (whitespace, currency symbol, locale). The `.ToString()` coupling means unrelated cosmetic changes break the test.  
**Fix:** Assert on the structured properties instead:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
Assert.AreEqual(1, summary.ItemCount);
Assert.AreEqual(99.99m, summary.Total);
```

