| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Low | Highest risk — silently passes broken code |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | Low | Split into two tests — eliminates hidden gap |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | Low | `await` the async call — removes 2 s flakiness |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | Low | Inline the CSV string — makes test portable |
